<!doctype html>
<html lang="{{ 'zh-CN' if language == 'zh' else 'en' }}">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ config.title }} · {{ authors }}</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="report.css"></head>
<body><main><header><div class="wordmark">nature <i>love</i><span class="bow">∞</span></div><small>PERSONAL ARCHIVE<br>{{ s.first_date }} / {{ s.last_date }}</small></header>
{% if s.synthetic %}<div class="demo">SYNTHETIC DEMO / 合成演示数据</div>{% endif %}
<p class="eyebrow">ARTICLE / {{ '个人纪念文章' if language == 'zh' else 'COMMUNITY EDITION' }}</p>
<h1>{{ config.title if config.title != 'Nature Love' else ('把不同，写成共同的日常' if language == 'zh' else 'Different voices, a shared everyday') }}</h1>
<p class="authors">{{ authors }}{% if config.joint_first_authors %} · {{ '共同第一作者' if language == 'zh' else 'Joint first authors' }}{% endif %}</p>
{% if config.relationship_date %}<p class="note">{{ '在一起的日子' if language == 'zh' else 'Together since' }}: {{ config.relationship_date }}{% if s.relationship_window %} · {{ s.relationship_window.calendar_dates }} {{ '个日期（含首尾）' if language == 'zh' else 'calendar dates, inclusive' }}{% endif %}</p>{% endif %}
<p class="abstract">{{ abstract }}</p>
<div class="facts"><div><b>{{ s.records }}</b><span>{{ '归档记录' if language == 'zh' else 'archive records' }}</span></div><div><b>{{ s.active_dates }}/{{ s.calendar_dates }}</b><span>{{ '有记录日期' if language == 'zh' else 'active dates' }}</span></div><div><b>{{ s.conversations }}</b><span>{{ '对话段' if language == 'zh' else 'conversations' }}</span></div></div>
{% for section in sections %}<section><p class="eyebrow">{{ '结果' if section.number < 8 else '个人画像' }} / {{ '%02d'|format(section.number) }}</p>
<h2>{{ section.title }}</h2><img class="figure" src="figures/Figure{{ section.number }}.png" alt="{{ section.title }}" loading="lazy">
<div class="columns">{% for paragraph in section.paragraphs %}<p>{{ paragraph }}</p>{% endfor %}</div></section>{% endfor %}
<section class="ending"><h2>{{ '讨论与方法' if language == 'zh' else 'Discussion and methods' }}</h2>
<p>{{ '连续性、消息量、回合组织与词汇重叠是不同维度。本报告提供描述性初稿；具体背景与解释应由参与者核对后补充。没有从观察关联推断人际影响或感情质量。' if language == 'zh' else 'Continuity, message volume, turn organization and lexical overlap are different dimensions. This is a descriptive draft; participants should supply and verify contextual interpretations. Observed associations do not establish interpersonal influence or relationship quality.' }}</p>
<p>{{ '时间戳按配置时区处理。非系统消息间隔超过阈值开始新对话，发送者切换或新对话开始新回合。调用标识归并通话，未识别提示保持独立的未归并计数。内容词采用 jieba 分词；抽样固定随机种子。' if language == 'zh' else 'Timestamps use the configured timezone. A gap above the threshold starts a conversation; a sender change or a new conversation starts a turn. Calls are grouped only by usable session identifiers. Content words use jieba and sampling uses a fixed seed.' }}</p>
<p>Conversation gap: {{ config.conversation_gap_hours }} h · Chat-day boundary: {{ config.day_boundary_hour }}:00 · Seed: {{ config.seed }}<br>Input SHA-256: <code>{{ s.quality.input_sha256 }}</code></p>
<p>{{ '语音/通话时长来自输入元数据；未执行转写、播放或手机完整性核验。字典覆盖、抽样范围与缺失项必须保留在解释中。' if language == 'zh' else 'Voice/call durations come from input metadata. No transcription, playback or phone-completeness verification is performed. Dictionary coverage, sampling ranges and missing values remain part of interpretation.' }}</p>
<h3>{{ '参考文献与软件' if language == 'zh' else 'References and software' }}</h3><ul><li><a href="https://doi.org/10.1093/pan/mpn018">Monroe et al. (2008), informative-prior word contrasts</a></li><li><a href="https://doi.org/10.1177/026192702237953">Niederhoffer &amp; Pennebaker (2002), linguistic style matching</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/fxsjy/jieba">jieba</a>; <a href="https://matplotlib.org/">matplotlib</a></li></ul>
<p class="note">Community commemorative project. Not affiliated with Nature Portfolio. Original correspondence stays local; generated reports and summaries may still contain private information.</p></section>
<footer>nature love · {{ '仍有下一页' if language == 'zh' else 'The next page is still yours' }}</footer></main></body></html>
